Consider the following method.

```java
public static int mystery(int[] arr)
{
    int count = 0;
    for (int i = 1; i < arr.length; i++)
    {
        if (arr[i] > arr[i - 1])
        {
            count++;
        }
    }
    return count;
}
```

What value is returned by the call `mystery(new int[]{3, 5, 2, 8, 9})`?

